---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';

const films = (await getCollection('films'))
  .sort((a, b) => parseInt(a.data.year) - parseInt(b.data.year));
const posts = (await getCollection('notebook'))
  .sort((a, b) => b.data.pubDate.valueOf() - a.data.pubDate.valueOf())
  .filter(post => !post.data.draft)
  .filter(post => post.data.topics?.includes('Film'))
  .slice(0,5);
const posters = (await getCollection('design'))
  .sort((a, b) => b.data.pubDate.valueOf() - a.data.pubDate.valueOf())
  .filter(post => post.data.category?.includes('Film Poster'))
  .slice(0,5);
const pageTitle = "Film - Thamara Kandabada";
---
<PageLayout title={pageTitle}>
<h1>Film</h1>
<p>I love film. I am not an expert, or a critic, but I enjoy watching films. I’m an avid cinema-goer, Letterboxd-logger, and physical media collector. I sometimes design retro-themed film posters. This page is a central hub for all the film-related content on this site, and some outside the site, too.</p>
<p>Don't ask me what my favourite film is; I don't have one. Or rather, the answer changes all the time. My four favourites on Letterboxd are updated regularly.</p>

<div class="grid">
  <div>
    <h2>Recent watches</h2>
      <p>These are the last five films I watched. The data is pulled from my Letterboxd profile using <a href="https://letterboxd-embed.timcieplowski.com/" target="_blank">a third-party tool</a>. The <i class="bi bi-recycle"></i> symbol indicates a rewatch.</p>
      <p>Click the poster to view my review/thoughts on Letterboxd.</p>
        <div id="letterboxd-embed-wrapper-tc">Loading...</div>
          <script>
            fetch('https://lb-embed-content.bokonon.dev?username=thamarak')
            .then(response => response.text())
            .then(data => {
            document.getElementById('letterboxd-embed-wrapper-tc').innerHTML = data;
            });
          </script>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2>My links</h2>
      <ul class="recent-blogposts-list">
        <li><a href="https://letterboxd.com/thamarak/" target="_blank">Letterboxd profile</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://physicalmedia.thamara.co.uk/" target="_blank">Physical media collection</a></li>
      </ul>
        <h2>Blog posts</h2>
        <p>The latest film-related posts from my blog.</p>
          <ul class="recent-blogposts-list">
              {posts.map(post => (
              <li><a href={`/notebook/${post.id}`}>{post.data.title}</a></li>
            ))}
            <li><strong><a href="/notebook/topics/film/">All film-related posts</a></strong></li>
          </ul>
    <h2>Posters</h2>
      <p>The latest film poster designs I've done.</p>
          <ul class="recent-blogposts-list">
              {posters.map(post => (
              <li><a href={`/design/${post.id}`}>{post.data.title}</a></li>
            ))}
            <li><strong><a href="/design/categories/film-poster/">All film posters</a></strong></li>
          </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<h2 id="cinema-calendar">Cinema calendar</h2>
<p>This calendar displays my upcoming cinema trips. All entries are in <a href="https://utctime.info/abbr/GMT/" target="_blank">GMT</a>.</p>
<iframe id="open-web-calendar" 
    style="background:url('https://raw.githubusercontent.com/niccokunzmann/open-web-calendar/master/static/img/loaders/circular-loader.gif') center center no-repeat;"
    src="https://owc.thamara.co.uk/calendar.html?controls=next&amp;controls=previous&amp;controls=date&amp;css=%2F*%20calendar.css%0A%20%20%20Paste%20into%20the%20%22Custom%20Style%20with%20CSS%22%20box%20of%20the%20Open%20Web%20Calendar%20configurator.%0A%20%20%20Works%20best%20on%20top%20of%20the%20Dark%20skin.%20*%2F%0A%0A%2F*%20Plein-Variable%3A%20the%20calendar%20page%20has%20to%20load%20the%20font%20itself%2C%20so%20it%20is%20declared%20here.%0A%20%20%20Point%20src%20at%20your%20real%20font%20file%20(search%20your%20repo%20for%20Plein-Variable%2C%20copy%20its%20src%20and%0A%20%20%20weight%20range%2C%20but%20keep%20the%20URL%20absolute).%20The%20file%20needs%20an%20Access-Control-Allow-Origin%0A%20%20%20header%2C%20because%20the%20calendar%20is%20served%20from%20a%20different%20origin%20than%20your%20site.%0A%20%20%20If%20you%20deploy%20your%20fork%20you%20can%20instead%20put%20the%20file%20in%20open_web_calendar%2Fstatic%2Ffonts%2F%0A%20%20%20and%20use%20url(&#039;%2Fstatic%2Ffonts%2FPlein-Variable.woff2&#039;)%2C%20which%20is%20same-origin%20and%20needs%20no%20header.%20*%2F%0A%40font-face%20%7B%0A%20%20font-family%3A%20Plein-Variable%3B%0A%20%20src%3A%20url(&#039;https%3A%2F%2Fthamara.co.uk%2Ffonts%2FPlein-Variable.woff2&#039;)%20format(&#039;woff2&#039;)%3B%0A%20%20font-weight%3A%20300%20900%3B%0A%20%20font-style%3A%20normal%3B%0A%20%20font-display%3A%20swap%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%3Aroot%20%7B%0A%20%20color-scheme%3A%20dark%3B%0A%0A%20%20--bg-primary%3A%20%2316213E%3B%0A%20%20--bg-secondary%3A%20%23161B22%3B%0A%20%20--bg-tertiary%3A%20%2321262D%3B%0A%20%20--text-primary%3A%20%23CBD5E1%3B%0A%20%20--text-secondary%3A%20%2394A3B8%3B%0A%20%20--accent%3A%20%234DA8DA%3B%0A%0A%20%20--muted-border-color%3A%20%23E9456050%3B%0A%20%20--border-muted%3A%201px%20solid%20var(--muted-border-color)%3B%0A%20%20--border-radius%3A%204px%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F*%20The%20calendar&#039;s%20skins%20are%20driven%20by%20CSS%20variables%20(Scheduler%207%2B)%2C%20so%20most%20of%20the%0A%20%20%20theming%20is%20just%20pointing%20them%20at%20your%20palette.%20*%2F%0A%3Aroot%2C%0A%3Aroot%5Bdata-scheduler-theme%5D%20%7B%0A%20%20--dhx-scheduler-base-colors-primary%3A%20var(--accent)%3B%0A%20%20--dhx-scheduler-base-colors-primary-hover%3A%20var(--accent)%3B%0A%20%20--dhx-scheduler-base-colors-primary-active%3A%20var(--accent)%3B%0A%20%20--dhx-scheduler-base-colors-primary-lighter%3A%20var(--bg-tertiary)%3B%0A%20%20--dhx-scheduler-base-colors-secondary%3A%20var(--bg-secondary)%3B%0A%20%20--dhx-scheduler-base-colors-select%3A%20var(--bg-tertiary)%3B%0A%20%20--dhx-scheduler-base-colors-hover-color%3A%20var(--bg-tertiary)%3B%0A%20%20--dhx-scheduler-base-colors-disabled%3A%20var(--bg-tertiary)%3B%0A%20%20%2F*%20Grid%20lines%2C%20scales%20and%20form%20controls%20*%2F%0A%20%20--dhx-scheduler-base-colors-border%3A%20var(--muted-border-color)%3B%0A%20%20--dhx-scheduler-base-colors-icons%3A%20var(--text-secondary)%3B%0A%20%20--dhx-scheduler-base-colors-text-base%3A%20var(--text-primary)%3B%0A%20%20--dhx-scheduler-base-colors-text-light%3A%20var(--text-secondary)%3B%0A%20%20--dhx-scheduler-base-colors-background%3A%20var(--bg-primary)%3B%0A%0A%20%20--dhx-scheduler-container-background%3A%20var(--bg-primary)%3B%0A%20%20--dhx-scheduler-container-color%3A%20var(--text-primary)%3B%0A%0A%20%20--dhx-scheduler-popup-background%3A%20var(--bg-secondary)%3B%0A%20%20--dhx-scheduler-popup-color%3A%20var(--text-primary)%3B%0A%20%20--dhx-scheduler-popup-border%3A%20var(--border-muted)%3B%0A%20%20--dhx-scheduler-popup-border-radius%3A%20var(--border-radius)%3B%0A%0A%20%20--dhx-scheduler-border-radius%3A%20var(--border-radius)%3B%0A%0A%20%20--dhx-scheduler-event-background%3A%20var(--accent)%3B%0A%20%20--dhx-scheduler-event-color%3A%20var(--bg-primary)%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F*%20Hooks%20that%20newer%20versions%20of%20the%20calendar%20expose%20(older%20ones%20ignore%20them)%20*%2F%0A%3Aroot%20%7B%0A%20%20--owc-today-background-color%3A%20var(--bg-tertiary)%3B%0A%20%20--owc-help-link-color%3A%20var(--accent)%3B%0A%20%20--owc-help-link-background-color%3A%20var(--bg-secondary)%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F*%20Font%3A%20the%20only%20one%20used%20anywhere%20in%20the%20calendar%20*%2F%0Ahtml%2C%0Abody%2C%0Abody%20*%20%7B%0A%20%20font-family%3A%20Plein-Variable%2C%20sans-serif%20!important%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F*%20Hamburger%20menu%3A%20older%20versions%20render%20it%20even%20when%20%22Show%20Menu%22%20is%20off%20*%2F%0Alabel%5Bfor%3D%22menu__toggle%22%5D%2C%0A%23menu__toggle%2C%0A%23menu-meta-data%20%7B%0A%20%20display%3A%20none%20!important%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Ahtml%2C%0Abody%20%7B%0A%20%20margin%3A%200%3B%0A%20%20background-color%3A%20var(--bg-primary)%3B%0A%20%20color%3A%20var(--text-primary)%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F*%20Safety%20net%3A%20backgrounds%20the%20variables%20don&#039;t%20always%20reach%20*%2F%0A.dhx_cal_container%20%7B%0A%20%20background-color%3A%20var(--bg-primary)%3B%0A%20%20color%3A%20var(--text-primary)%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A.dhx_cal_container%20.dhx_cal_navline%2C%0A.dhx_cal_container%20.dhx_cal_header%20%7B%0A%20%20background-color%3A%20var(--bg-secondary)%3B%0A%20%20border-color%3A%20var(--muted-border-color)%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A.dhx_cal_container%20.dhx_scale_bar%20%7B%0A%20%20color%3A%20var(--text-secondary)%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A.dhx_cal_container%20.dhx_cal_scale_placeholder%2C%0A.dhx_cal_container%20.dhx_scale_holder%2C%0A.dhx_cal_container%20.dhx_scale_hour%20%7B%0A%20%20background-color%3A%20var(--bg-primary)%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A.dhx_cal_container%20.dhx_scale_hour%20%7B%0A%20%20color%3A%20var(--text-secondary)%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F*%20Left%20edge%3A%20the%20grid%20only%20draws%20right%20and%20bottom%20borders%2C%20so%20give%20the%20first%20column%20a%20left%20line.%0A%20%20%20Inset%20shadows%20paint%20inside%20the%20cell%2C%20so%20nothing%20shifts.%20*%2F%0A.dhx_cal_container%20.dhx_cal_header%20.dhx_scale_bar%3Afirst-child%2C%0A.dhx_cal_container%20.dhx_cal_scale_placeholder%2C%0A.dhx_cal_container%20.dhx_month_head%3Afirst-child%2C%0A.dhx_cal_container%20.dhx_month_body%3Afirst-child%2C%0A.dhx_cal_container%20.dhx_scale_hour%20%7B%0A%20%20box-shadow%3A%20inset%201px%200%200%20var(--muted-border-color)%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F*%20Header%20controls%3A%20today%20button%20and%20view%20tabs%20*%2F%0A.dhx_cal_container%20.dhx_cal_today_button%2C%0A.dhx_cal_container%20.dhx_cal_tab%20%7B%0A%20%20color%3A%20var(--text-primary)%3B%0A%20%20background-color%3A%20transparent%3B%0A%20%20border%3A%20var(--border-muted)%3B%0A%20%20border-radius%3A%20var(--border-radius)%3B%0A%20%20box-shadow%3A%20none%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A.dhx_cal_container%20.dhx_cal_today_button%3Ahover%2C%0A.dhx_cal_container%20.dhx_cal_tab%3Anot(.active)%3Ahover%20%7B%0A%20%20background-color%3A%20var(--bg-tertiary)%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A.dhx_cal_container%20.dhx_cal_tab.active%20%7B%0A%20%20color%3A%20var(--bg-primary)%3B%0A%20%20background-color%3A%20var(--accent)%3B%0A%20%20border-color%3A%20var(--accent)%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F*%20Events%3A%20one%20colour%20for%20all%20of%20them%2C%20overriding%20the%20calendar&#039;s%20own%20colours.%0A%20%20%20Delete%20the%20two%20variable%20lines%20to%20get%20the%20calendar&#039;s%20colours%20back.%20*%2F%0A.event%20%7B%0A%20%20--dhx-scheduler-event-background%3A%20var(--accent)%20!important%3B%0A%20%20--dhx-scheduler-event-color%3A%20var(--bg-primary)%20!important%3B%0A%20%20border-radius%3A%20var(--border-radius)%3B%0A%7D&amp;menu_shows_calendar_names=false&amp;menu_shows_description=false&amp;menu_shows_title=false&amp;skin=dark&amp;timezone=Europe%2FLondon&amp;title=Film&amp;url=webcal%3A%2F%2Fp115-caldav.icloud.com%2Fpublished%2F2%2FNjcxMDgyMzAyNjcxMDgyMxg5_o60InHpUMqb7TXouSt60-MUpkZmpjUh0kf3FfFWm1y2lHc8Y66QIlXdgwjlnzNDO-oOT-KuKQGzAaLlbyE"
    sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-top-navigation allow-downloads"
    allowTransparency="true" scrolling="no" 
    frameborder="0" height="784px" width="100%"></iframe>

<h2 id="my-favourite-films">My favourite films from each year</h2>
  <p>These are my favourite films from each year, going back as far as I have seen them. <strong>Important:</strong> note that these are personal favourites, not necessarily the best films of each year (I wouldn't dare make such claims).</p>
  <p>There are some years I have only seen one or two films from. Picking a favourite is a much less meaningful exercise in those cases, but I have done so as a reminder to myself to watch more films.</p>
  <p>The release dates are per TMDB. Each film is linked to its respective Wikipedia page.</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th scope="col">Year</th>
        <th scope="col">Film</th>
        <th scope="col">Director</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {films.map(film => (
        <tr>
          <td>{film.data.year}</td>
          <td><a href={`${film.data.url}`} target="_blank"><em>{film.data.title}</em></a>
          {film.data.notes && (
            <br /><small>Close contenders: <em>{film.data.notes}</em></small>
          )}</td>
          <td>{film.data.director}</td>
        </tr>
      ))}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</PageLayout>